      426.25,
      547.14,
      463.36
    ],
    "text": "I, Thalatha Atukorale, Minister of Justice and Prison Reforms, do by this Notification, fix with effect from 15th of March 2019Rupees Twenty Million, as the amount for the purpose of paragraph (1) of the First Schedule to the High Court of theProvinces (Special Provisions) Act, No. 10 of 1996, in lieu of the sum of Rupees Five Million.",
